---
description: Keep secrets and private inventory out of git
alwaysApply: true
---

# No secrets in the repo

- Do not commit passwords, tokens, kubeconfigs, or `.env` files that hold credentials.
- Do not paste those values into chat replies or into files that will be pushed.
- Point at a local path if the agent needs a secret (`~/.ssh/.example_pass`, chmod 600).
- Treat this tree as public unless the remote is known-private.
